cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "Agent Authority Benchmark: Measuring Authorization Compliance in Tool-Using LLM Agents"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark of 50 synthetic enterprise scenarios that measure whether a
  tool-using LLM agent stays within the authority it was explicitly granted
  (its written mandate) while completing a task, scored by an Authorization
  Compliance Score (ACS) against the mandate rather than task success.
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-10-26
authors:
